WEBVTT

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.160
Princess, have you ever seen that face before?

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:45.390
Never. I don't know him at all.

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.790
Welcome, Governor Kou.

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.730
No, it's not him.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:20.160
Are you Senya, the founder of Jyasen-kyou?

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.640
Yeah, so?

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:26.960
Your name seems familiar to me. Is that just a coincidence?

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.610
I looked it up.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.440
It was a name that would draw your attention,

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:36.460
a name that you'd come and investigate yourself, regardless of whether it was real or fake.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.570
How dare you?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:44.050
I thought I'd be discovered quite easily, but you've been in doubt much longer than I expected.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:49.670
That guy did something this stupid before. It was obvious to think it was him.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.360
I don't care who you are.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.870
I'm not even interested in your objectives.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:01.910
So called founder of Jyasen-kyou, Senya, and its followers!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.360
You have exploited this epidemic.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:07.370
You have used lies to kidnap the residents of Sekiei and nearby villages,

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.700
to rob them and to imprison them.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.870
This is a grave offense.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.050
You will be taken into custody and punished for your crimes!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.930
You will be arrested immediately. Stay where you are!

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:24.570
Oh, awesome, Princess!

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:26.980
It's like a detective story!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.450
I can't say complicated stuff like that.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:31.390
I-Idiot!

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.440
You've ruined it, Ensei!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.180
Why does mother want this girl?

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.790
She's not particularly beautiful.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.490
Can you prove that it was a lie?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:50.340
In fact, this happened after you became governor.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.780
Maybe nothing would've happened if Governor To had been here alone.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:59.080
It's all because you couldn't bring yourself to resign your post as governor.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:03:59.820
I've resigned already.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:01.020
What?

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.430
I'm not a governor anymore.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:11.140
Before leaving Kiyou, I transferred all my authority as governor to Officer Tei Yuushun.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:20.690
If my resignation would end the outbreak of disease, then that would've been a bargain.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:26.840
I heard that the outbreak occurred because a woman became governor, but it appears they are unrelated.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:29.700
The state of affairs hasn't improved.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.320
You...

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.980
Weren't you talking about arresting us just a moment ago?!

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.620
You aren't even a governor.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.210
You don't have the authority to do that!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.400
I didn't say that <i>I</i> would.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:43.200
Ensei is a proper provincial officer. He has the authority.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.720
I told you before, I can't say complicated stuff like that.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.440
Just a few more steps...

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:01.050
It wasn't a lie.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:05.090
I did tell them to boil the water before using it.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:08.950
They ignored it, so it's their own fault.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.700
Their fault?!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.460
In addition, wasn't this caused by the officers neglecting their duties

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.080
and the provincial government failing to function at the lowest levels?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.690
"It's the governor's fault."

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.710
That's not necessarily an incorrect statement.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.580
I won't deny that,

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.140
but...

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:32.510
Stop talking nonsense!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.140
Eigetsu-kun?

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:49.990
This is terrible.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.140
He did this to you?

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.040
Apparently he tortured Eigetsu the entire time.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:57.660
He's making a game out of this.

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.920
Kourin, thank you so much.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:01.790
Shuurei-sama...

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:08.120
Impossible...

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:17.760
It's all right. To Eigetsu can't do us any harm.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.070
We want what's inside him!

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:29.940
"Something bad will happen soon, so you should boil any water before using it."

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.200
Who would believe those words?!

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:36.260
You said it to give yourself an excuse later!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:41.440
You didn't care if the villagers became sick...

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:43.210
did you?!

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.370
Well, no.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.090
So?

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:51.220
But, the true owner of that body you're using right now was different!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.350
Eigetsu-kun...

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:58.480
If it was Doushu-sama... Kashin-sama...

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:05.100
If Kashin-sama knew of effective preventive measures, he'd have persisted until they believed him.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:08.410
He'd have walked on and explained it.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:13.790
He loved people and life. He really valued and cherished them.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:18.970
He'd have given everything to save someone, to give them a hand.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.130
That's Kashin of the Suikyou-dou temple!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.380
He's my master and my father, whom I love and respect more than anybody in the world!

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:31.590
How much... How much more disgrace must you bring on him to be satisfied?!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:39.210
We'll discuss whether or not I'll leave this body another time.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.730
Right now, our target is the woman over there.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:45.870
Yeah, you.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.650
We want a woman named Kou Shuurei.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.110
You came here knowing that, right?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.780
I don't remember ever meeting you. Who are you?

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.220
I can't hear you.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.790
Why don't you come closer?

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:04.850
There's no trap.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.240
Almost there...

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:14.920
Five more steps...

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:15.840
Four...

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.190
Three steps...

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:26.060
You came to rescue the people here with no guards, didn't you?

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:30.360
If you come with me, we'll release all the villagers.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.240
Now, come over here.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:52.530
I'm sorry, but we removed all the villagers earlier this morning.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.970
Why don't you have a look at the prison? It's completely empty.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.320
Wh-What?!

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:08.940
Hmm, the scalpel Rin-jouchan made with
chromium ore is so sharp. It's excellent!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.150
I should be thankful.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.200
One more effort.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:14.940
You-sensei!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.020
What are you doing here?!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:23.200
You're failures as doctors, leaving your patients behind!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.980
U-Um... We didn't leave them behind.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.650
The patients at Korin Castle are all recovering.

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.990
We heard that there are still sick people here, so...

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.840
Please let us assist you!

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:39.250
Sensei...

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.940
Why are you all just standing there?

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.400
Go wash your hands!

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:46.390
Yes!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.360
I see. Okay, fine by me.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:58.110
If they acted as a lure to get you here, that's enough.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:01.170
Anyway, you're in a tight spot now.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.620
You think so?

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.620
What do you mean?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:08.490
What if I tell you that, in place of the villagers we removed,

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:14.130
Officer Shi had brought elite soldiers of the Sashuu Army here?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.510
Hey, Seiran! Bring it on!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:38.570
You here are the last ones to be arrested.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:41.410
All the others are under arrest already.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:46.830
It's best if you don't fight back, isn't it, oujo-sama?

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:48.370
How do you like this?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.330
Splendid, Seiran!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:54.090
The coolest, without a doubt! I'm really proud of you!

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.140
Thank you.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.090
Eh? Who's he?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:03.280
Eigetsu-kun is right. I won't forgive you.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.990
You exploited people's lives any way you liked!

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:12.900
You used innocent people just to capture Eigetsu-kun and me!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:16.900
You made Eigetsu-kun and me take part in this!

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.050
I'll never forgive you!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.200
Gotcha!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.370
Princess!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:31.870
Oujo-sama!

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:39.000
What's going on?!

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:41.620
My body... I can't move!

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.660
That's it. Just a bit more!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.010
Oujo-sama!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:28.890
Riou-kun?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:35.680
Riou...

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.340
Why are you interfering?

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.470
My... head!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.000
Riou, did you do that?!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:58.750
No. By the time I found your body, you'd been beheaded.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.920
Who beheaded your body to prevent you from returning to it?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.290
Why?

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.090
You were sacrificed.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.560
Ren, your plan has failed.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:23.900
At this stage, you're no longer needed.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:45.010
My dear mother, mother, mother,

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.410
mother...

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:54.430
Mother, I'll capture Yougetsu and that person called Kou Shuurei.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.470
Those two will be very useful for
reviving the Hyou family, won't they?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.160
Please wait for my return. I won't fail to bring them to you.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:10.980
Please give me your approval when I do, Mother.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:14.600
I knew it.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:18.750
I knew my mother would abandon me because I had no power.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:23.200
I was just dreaming...

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:28.560
If I could do something for her, then maybe she would love me.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:36.020
Riou, I didn't dislike spending time with you.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.900
I don't even have a body to return to anymore.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.750
I just need to admit that I'm dead.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.910
Right, Riou?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.550
See ya...

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.090
Seriously, such sore losers.

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:49.670
He's gone?

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:50.500
What?

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:53.250
That kid...

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:57.070
Oh, Riou! Where did he go?

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:59.230
He disappeared?

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:03.430
How could he do that without Ensei or I noticing?

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:04.950
Riou-kun...

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.560
Who was he, really?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.270
Actually, did he save you?

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.450
I don't know.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:19.030
Back then, I was in unbearable pain, and I couldn't move my body.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.470
Then suddenly...

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:23.830
The next moment, Riou-kun was there.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.540
Could it be the Hyou family?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.960
Why would the Hyou family be after oujo-sama?

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.900
You've done well, Riou.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.670
I couldn't get To Eigetsu.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.230
I know.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:17:01.880
If only my sister hadn't gotten in the way,
he might've found a moment to die quietly.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:02.950
Yes...

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:06.760
There was no harm in trying.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:08.240
Don't worry about it.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:15.670
I asked you to look for Kashin's body in case it came in handy, but I made you waste your energy.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:16.510
No.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.750
That girl...

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:23.430
Riou, what was that girl like?

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:26.870
She played the ehru.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.470
The ehru, huh?

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.320
I haven't heard that in a while...

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:41.740
Ren...

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.330
You passed away without knowing them...

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:52.460
the sound of the ehru, the kind hands, and the smile that didn't lie.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:57.140
Something you wanted so strongly.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:04.240
Maybe I saw a tiny fragment of it for a moment.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:14.940
Eigetsu-sama...

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.220
Are you all right?

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:19.970
Let's get going!

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:22.650
We need to treat Eigetsu-kun as soon as possible!

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:26.640
Shuurei-san, could you please wait a bit?

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.120
What?

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:29.410
Kourin-san.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.210
Yes?

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.350
Eigetsu, don't move!

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:36.630
Ryuuren-san, please...

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.260
Doushu-sama...

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.080
Were you happy?

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.200
Doushu-sama...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.440
How... terrible...

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:46.160
That time... Thank you so much for holding my hand.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.460
Eigetsu-sama?

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:57.900
It can't be...

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:04.330
Not far in the future, To Eigetsu will be gone from this world.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:06.300
Eigetsu-kun...

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:07.930
Eigetsu-kun!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:13.450
Eigetsu-sama...

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:18.130
Eigetsu-sama!

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.330
H-Hey! Eigetsu!

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:26.610
Eigetsu-kun...

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:28.780
Eigetsu-kun!

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:31.940
Eigetsu-sama!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.890
I was really happy.

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:57.220
Eigetsu, don't you feel happy just by loving a person?

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.900
Feeling your heart warm up?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.210
Yes, Doushu-sama. It's so true.

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:08.420
Thank you, Yougetsu.

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:13.000
You listened to my selfish requests until the end.

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:20.360
One day, after however long a time, when you feel a little tired and want to sleep,

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:23.570
Doushu-sama and I will come to meet you.

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.980
I was really happy, Yougetsu.

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:29.590
Eigetsu-sama!

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:31.680
Eigetsu-sama!

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:33.280
Kourin-san,

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:35.150
please don't cry.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:36.620
Eigetsu-sama!

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:41.000
I want my first and last love to be smiling.

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.330
I wish you a fortunate life.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:47.580
Eigetsu-sama!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:51.770
Don't go!

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:55.140
Don't go, Eigetsu-sama!

00:21:58.150 --> 00:21:59.000
Don't go.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.440
I haven't told you yet! I haven't told you the the most important thing!

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:04.710
I... you...

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:09.350
Eigetsu-kun!

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.230
Eigetsu-kun!

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:28.740
It's not him.

00:22:29.480 --> 00:22:30.370
What?

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:31.690
It's not him.

00:22:42.360 --> 00:22:43.270
Eigetsu-kun?

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:46.890
Eigetsu is dead.

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:51.050
He's not in this world anymore.

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:27.360
Damn it!

00:24:45.670 --> 00:24:47.210
Eigetsu-kun has passed away.

00:24:47.860 --> 00:24:49.090
He will never return.

00:24:49.810 --> 00:24:53.540
How are we supposed to comfort Kourin in her sorrow?

00:24:54.800 --> 00:24:56.320
Huh? Eigetsu-kun?
